# Portfolio Core

This is an art-directed personal portfolio.

Never default to generic SaaS / developer portfolio aesthetics.

The site must feel:

- human
- curious
- playful
- technically serious
- slightly strange

Maximalism is controlled.

Motion has meaning.

3D has purpose.

Content must never be fabricated.

Visual quality is the primary product requirement.
